WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.534
You record a payment against an issued invoice. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:09.163
In Billing, select Invoices, then select See Invoice.

2.1
00:00:09.163 --> 00:00:15.587
Step 2. Select Record Payment. The Collect Payment form shows the Amount Due.

3.1
00:00:15.587 --> 00:00:19.419
Step 3. Select the Payment Method and the Location.

3.2
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:23.984
Amount Paid starts at the full invoice total, not the Amount Due.

3.3
00:00:23.984 --> 00:00:25.889
Change it if needed.

4.1
00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:28.401
Step 4. Select Record Payment.

4.2
00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:32.973
Care saves it and shows Payment Recorded Successfully.

5.1
00:00:32.973 --> 00:00:35.759
Step 5. Check the invoice status.

5.2
00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:40.409
Care can mark a fully paid invoice Balanced by itself.
